WEBVTT

00:04.338 --> 00:09.173
Our powers were granted only to protect someone else.

00:24.592 --> 00:27.117
Reading the paths of the wind.

00:28.195 --> 00:31.892
We use this power for just one person...

00:31.966 --> 00:35.265
...to protect the one we all choose to protect.

00:36.337 --> 00:40.831
And you are responsible for choosing that person yourself.

00:41.909 --> 00:45.174
The harder you wish to protect that person...

00:45.246 --> 00:47.180
...the more our winds strengthen.

00:48.249 --> 00:51.446
Have you decided who you want to protect yet?

00:52.520 --> 00:54.545
No, not yet.

00:54.622 --> 00:57.853
But I believe that I'm sure to find that person.

00:57.925 --> 01:00.860
Do you have someone you want to protect, Daisuke?

01:04.698 --> 01:08.293
I want to do my best and become someone like you.

01:09.370 --> 01:11.235
I want to be stronger, and...

01:12.306 --> 01:14.638
As long as your heart doesn't waver...

01:15.709 --> 01:17.574
...the wind will be your ally.

01:21.248 --> 01:22.579
Yes!

01:22.650 --> 01:26.642
Episode 15
Guardian

01:30.624 --> 01:31.716
Princess.

01:31.792 --> 01:34.352
There is someone who wishes to see you.

01:34.428 --> 01:35.520
What should we do?

01:37.031 --> 01:38.862
Let him through...

01:38.933 --> 01:42.266
But you are not looking all that well.

01:42.336 --> 01:43.826
It is all right.

01:43.904 --> 01:47.362
I will bring you medicinal tea, so please stay still.

01:51.579 --> 01:55.106
Lord Saiki, can I do something for you?

01:55.182 --> 01:56.979
N-No.

01:57.051 --> 01:59.144
It seems you're tired...

01:59.220 --> 02:01.780
I'd like to suggest that you rest awhile.

02:03.157 --> 02:07.150
I am a dreamseer who sees fragments of the future in dreams.

02:08.229 --> 02:10.595
Even if I rest, true respite...

02:14.101 --> 02:17.161
You were troubled as to what to say to me?

02:17.238 --> 02:18.637
Well, um...

02:20.908 --> 02:25.038
How many years has it been, Lord Saiki,

02:25.112 --> 02:27.603
since you started serving me?

02:27.681 --> 02:29.979
It's almost eight years now.

02:30.050 --> 02:33.577
Are you dissatisfied with that destiny at all?

02:33.654 --> 02:35.281
Princess Hinoto, I...

02:35.356 --> 02:40.794
It was decided before you were born that you would serve me.

02:40.861 --> 02:44.729
Aren't you dissatisfied with a future decided by others...

02:44.798 --> 02:48.632
...long before you were born into this world?

02:48.702 --> 02:53.105
I chose the destiny of protecting you of my own will.

02:53.173 --> 02:55.869
I may not feel fortunate at times,

02:55.943 --> 02:57.934
but I haven't once felt dissatisfied.

02:58.012 --> 03:00.879
Even if I was no longer a dreamseer?

03:02.283 --> 03:07.516
I cannot see any dreams at all of the recent strange events.

03:07.588 --> 03:08.953
That's a good thing.

03:10.357 --> 03:11.585
Why?

03:11.659 --> 03:13.991
I'm actually relieved to hear that.

03:14.061 --> 03:16.495
Dreams that foreshadow Earth's future...

03:16.564 --> 03:19.556
...must all be tough on you, Princess Hinoto.

03:25.439 --> 03:29.967
I can do nothing but make you worry, Lord Saiki.

03:30.044 --> 03:31.841
T-That's not true...

03:31.912 --> 03:32.810
Thank you.

03:36.283 --> 03:39.343
Princess, the one that wishes to see you.

03:58.872 --> 04:00.601
The intruder's status?

04:00.674 --> 04:03.142
We turned every power source off,

04:03.210 --> 04:05.371
but we're not sure if we shook them.

04:05.446 --> 04:08.938
But how did they access this lab?

04:09.016 --> 04:13.077
The lab's system isn't connected to any network at all.

04:13.153 --> 04:15.621
There's no way some outsider could...

04:15.689 --> 04:17.281
There are those that can.

04:18.359 --> 04:21.817
If it's someone tied to the future of the Earth.

04:21.895 --> 04:23.089
What was stolen?

04:23.931 --> 04:27.799
The intruder was after all data concerning Nataku.

04:43.517 --> 04:46.247
Looks like the lab shut down all power.

04:46.320 --> 04:48.788
It seems we have to head there ourselves...

04:48.856 --> 04:50.517
...for your life support data.

04:51.825 --> 04:53.588
Why do such a thing?

04:53.661 --> 04:57.222
You don't want to return to that lab, do you?

04:57.297 --> 04:58.730
I told you.

04:58.799 --> 05:03.600
The seven fated to be Dragons of Earth, the Seven Angels...

05:03.671 --> 05:06.834
...don't need to act as a group.

05:06.907 --> 05:09.876
Do whatever you want however you want.

05:09.943 --> 05:13.572
But you said you didn't want to go anywhere.

05:13.647 --> 05:15.877
Nataku, what is your wish?

05:16.784 --> 05:18.081
I don't know.

05:18.152 --> 05:21.747
But I think I don't want to be parted from you.

05:21.822 --> 05:23.517
Why?

05:23.590 --> 05:24.579
Dad...

05:25.659 --> 05:28.389
Because you look like... Dad.

05:29.463 --> 05:31.556
What did your father call you?

05:32.633 --> 05:33.565
Kazuki.

05:34.601 --> 05:35.795
Kazuki...

05:35.869 --> 05:39.805
If that's your wish, I'll grant it for you.

05:41.442 --> 05:44.138
As well as the Earth's wish.

05:44.211 --> 05:48.477
Yes, he has a different air around him again nowadays.

05:48.549 --> 05:51.814
At first, he seemed to be just a cold-hearted man.

05:51.885 --> 05:54.786
Now he laughs on occasion like a child,

05:54.855 --> 05:57.153
and even seems kind on occasion.

05:57.224 --> 05:59.852
But his overwhelming presence hasn't changed.

06:01.228 --> 06:04.197
The ice-like coldness and overwhelming presence...

06:04.264 --> 06:08.166
...that I felt when he awoke a Dragon of Earth hasn't changed.

06:09.570 --> 06:11.538
What is this feeling?

06:11.605 --> 06:12.867
I have a bad hunch...

06:13.941 --> 06:15.875
You haven't been seeing dreams?

06:15.943 --> 06:18.377
Does that mean nothing will happen?

06:18.445 --> 06:21.141
No, I do not think it means that.

06:21.215 --> 06:22.910
Perhaps...

06:22.983 --> 06:26.419
This is the doing of the Dragon of Earth dreamseer.

06:26.487 --> 06:28.546
The Dragon of Earth dreamseer?

06:28.622 --> 06:31.386
You're saying he's interfering with your dreams?

06:31.458 --> 06:33.483
I believe so.

06:33.560 --> 06:37.519
I hope it is only me feeling so...

06:37.598 --> 06:40.396
The time should already be closing in.

06:41.969 --> 06:43.493
You said before...

06:43.570 --> 06:47.165
...that Dragons of Heaven are able to create Barrier Fields.

06:47.241 --> 06:48.299
Yes.

06:48.375 --> 06:53.074
Every Dragon of Heaven has the power to create Barrier Fields.

06:54.148 --> 06:55.615
But I don't yet.

06:56.683 --> 06:58.116
Tell me.

06:58.185 --> 07:01.086
How do you create a Barrier Field?

07:01.155 --> 07:05.922
The Dragons of Heaven were born with that power.

07:05.993 --> 07:07.790
I cannot say.

07:07.861 --> 07:09.055
I see.

07:09.129 --> 07:13.156
Kamui, I am sure that someday you will.

07:13.233 --> 07:14.257
Yeah.

07:14.334 --> 07:17.064
Let me know if you dream anything else.

07:17.137 --> 07:18.297
Yes.

07:18.372 --> 07:21.000
- I'll drop by again.
- I'll see you out.

07:28.015 --> 07:30.108
- Saiki!
- Princess!

07:30.184 --> 07:31.674
What is the matter?

07:31.752 --> 07:33.811
No, nothing.

07:33.887 --> 07:35.752
Please rest.

07:35.823 --> 07:37.415
I beg you, Princess.

07:38.992 --> 07:40.516
Don't mind me...

07:40.594 --> 07:42.152
Please don't mind me.

07:45.132 --> 07:47.066
Are your injuries fine now?

07:48.936 --> 07:52.303
Yeah, as you can see, I'm all healed now.

07:52.372 --> 07:53.862
I'm sorry for back then.

07:55.075 --> 07:56.542
No, it's all right.

07:56.610 --> 07:58.976
I said some horrible things, too.

07:59.046 --> 08:01.037
D-Don't worry about it.

08:05.219 --> 08:06.151
Kamui!

08:08.322 --> 08:12.349
I asked the same question a long time ago, too.

08:12.426 --> 08:14.951
How do you make a Barrier Field...

08:15.028 --> 08:16.427
...to Seiichiro.

08:16.496 --> 08:17.861
Seiichiro?

08:17.931 --> 08:20.832
Yeah, Seiichiro Aoki.

08:20.901 --> 08:22.528
You may not know this,

08:22.603 --> 08:26.699
but I'm from a family of windmasters, just like him.

08:26.773 --> 08:30.265
He taught me how to control the wind.

08:30.344 --> 08:35.509
But I couldn't make a Barrier since I wasn't one of the Seven Seals.

08:36.984 --> 08:38.542
The Barrier Field's a power...

08:38.619 --> 08:41.816
...that only the Dragons of Heaven, the Seven Seals, possess.

08:41.889 --> 08:45.882
How you ask, but I can't really put it into words.

08:45.959 --> 08:48.257
But I'm sure controlling the wind...

08:48.328 --> 08:51.422
...and making a Barrier Field is the same principle.

08:51.498 --> 08:54.160
Each time, I think of what is dear to me.

08:55.502 --> 08:58.767
That I want to protect what's important with these hands.

08:58.839 --> 09:02.536
The heart wishing to protect creates a Barrier.

09:04.444 --> 09:07.140
The heart wishing to protect?

09:07.214 --> 09:10.513
Yeah, I'm not sure if that serves as any reference,

09:10.584 --> 09:13.246
but it might come in handy at least a little bit.

09:15.455 --> 09:16.683
I see.

09:16.757 --> 09:19.817
You saw me out to tell me that.

09:19.893 --> 09:22.054
N-No, it's not that...

09:22.129 --> 09:23.824
Saiki, thanks.

09:23.897 --> 09:26.365
S-Stop it, I don't need thanks...

09:27.668 --> 09:28.692
W-What?

09:37.311 --> 09:38.243
It's that!

09:40.580 --> 09:41.740
A Dragon of Earth...

09:41.815 --> 09:44.010
It's towards Ikebukuro!

09:44.084 --> 09:44.982
Kamui!

09:59.967 --> 10:01.298
Nataku!

10:01.368 --> 10:03.268
W-Why?

10:03.337 --> 10:06.067
Because he wished it so.

10:06.139 --> 10:07.071
He?

10:09.343 --> 10:12.972
I just wanted to know Nataku's life support method.

10:13.046 --> 10:17.039
Now that I have the information, there is no need for this lab.

10:17.117 --> 10:18.015
You are...

10:19.353 --> 10:21.651
I am the Dragon of Earth "Kamui."

10:21.722 --> 10:23.519
K-Kamui?

10:23.590 --> 10:26.081
If you respond to the name "Kamui"...

10:26.159 --> 10:29.026
...it would seem you know at least some of this.

10:29.096 --> 10:30.825
What should we do, Nataku?

10:34.701 --> 10:35.998
In the end...

10:36.069 --> 10:39.402
...your body never housed a soul,

10:39.473 --> 10:43.136
and you never gained any emotions.

10:44.211 --> 10:45.200
A pity...

10:46.279 --> 10:47.371
...Kazuki.

10:49.850 --> 10:50.782
Oh?

11:00.394 --> 11:02.157
The other "Kamui" is here.

11:03.430 --> 11:04.795
Let's play a bit.

11:08.135 --> 11:09.067
Here?

11:30.057 --> 11:32.321
At this rate, if this collapses...

11:32.392 --> 11:34.360
I'm sure everyone will die.

11:41.468 --> 11:42.366
Fuma!

11:46.239 --> 11:48.036
I am "Kamui."

11:59.553 --> 12:02.317
You chose to become a Dragon of Heaven.

12:03.390 --> 12:05.858
I will become a Dragon of Earth...

12:05.926 --> 12:09.953
And to all Dragons of Heaven, the Seven Seals...

12:10.030 --> 12:11.554
...I will give death.

12:17.671 --> 12:19.332
You want to play, right?

12:23.844 --> 12:27.439
You know how to save this place, right?

12:29.483 --> 12:30.677
A Barrier...

12:30.750 --> 12:34.618
Though it's still impossible for you, Kamui.

12:35.789 --> 12:37.416
How...

12:37.491 --> 12:38.423
How?

12:40.560 --> 12:43.085
I know everything about you.

12:51.438 --> 12:52.530
Fuma...

12:56.243 --> 12:59.406
Because I'm "Kamui", just like you.

13:05.585 --> 13:06.882
Stop it.

13:06.953 --> 13:08.386
Let go of Kamui!

13:17.397 --> 13:19.024
Princess Hinoto, huh...

13:20.634 --> 13:23.194
The one most dear to you...

13:23.270 --> 13:26.967
...is the dreamgazing princess beneath the Diet building.

13:27.040 --> 13:30.441
You want to protect the dreamseer named Hinoto.

13:30.510 --> 13:32.842
That is your wish.

13:32.913 --> 13:34.403
Is it not?

13:34.481 --> 13:35.971
S-Shut up!

13:36.049 --> 13:37.141
I know.

13:38.418 --> 13:40.113
Not just your wish.

13:41.188 --> 13:43.122
I know everyone's wishes.

13:44.391 --> 13:46.291
Because I am "Kamui."

13:46.359 --> 13:48.623
The one who hunts the will of god.

13:50.497 --> 13:51.623
Damn you!

13:56.436 --> 13:57.698
Lord Saiki...

14:01.942 --> 14:03.534
It's just like the dreams.

14:05.712 --> 14:08.146
The dreamseer of the Dragons of Earth.

14:09.216 --> 14:14.210
You have already seen in your dreams that he will not run away.

14:18.358 --> 14:22.692
What does Hinoto think of your wish?

14:44.484 --> 14:46.213
What's wrong?

14:46.286 --> 14:47.548
Is that all?

14:51.458 --> 14:53.358
Stop it! Please!

14:58.932 --> 15:02.595
It seems Hinoto thinks of you at least a little bit.

15:10.677 --> 15:14.078
Next time, even your dear, little princess...

15:14.147 --> 15:15.478
...will be torn to shreds.

15:16.783 --> 15:18.341
Stop it!

15:18.418 --> 15:19.350
Stop it.

15:19.419 --> 15:20.977
I won't let you...

15:22.055 --> 15:23.147
...do that!

15:24.224 --> 15:25.987
That's right.

15:26.059 --> 15:29.893
You decided to become stronger for that one reason.

15:36.836 --> 15:41.432
Your wish is to guard Hinoto with your life.

15:42.842 --> 15:46.005
Which means to die protecting Hinoto.

15:50.283 --> 15:51.682
That wish of yours...

15:56.323 --> 15:58.223
Stop it, Lord Saiki!

15:59.292 --> 16:00.919
I'll grant it for you.

16:02.729 --> 16:05.698
No!

16:08.401 --> 16:09.493
Daisuke...

16:16.943 --> 16:17.875
Saiki!

16:25.618 --> 16:26.642
Saiki...

16:29.155 --> 16:31.146
A little too late.

16:31.224 --> 16:32.987
I just finished up.

16:51.911 --> 16:53.003
What's wrong?

16:59.219 --> 17:00.481
Lord Saiki...

17:01.921 --> 17:06.358
This is just too terrible...

17:07.861 --> 17:09.556
But you knew.

17:11.131 --> 17:13.759
You knew that this would happen.

17:13.833 --> 17:16.267
And now he is dead.

17:16.336 --> 17:18.804
Just as you saw in your dreams.

17:18.872 --> 17:20.339
But still, I...

17:21.408 --> 17:24.502
...wanted to save Lord Saiki.

17:25.712 --> 17:28.545
The future is already decided.

17:28.615 --> 17:32.711
No matter what you do, that won't change.

17:32.786 --> 17:33.810
But still...

17:34.888 --> 17:37.982
But still, I can't help but wish...

17:39.225 --> 17:41.523
...for a different future!

17:41.594 --> 17:45.428
But the Dragon of Heaven "Kamui"...

17:45.498 --> 17:48.490
...can't win against the Dragon of Earth "Kamui."

17:48.568 --> 17:49.660
Never.

18:11.257 --> 18:12.690
You want to aim...

18:15.528 --> 18:16.620
...here.

18:22.368 --> 18:23.801
What's wrong?

18:23.870 --> 18:26.737
If you break me here, I will die.

18:29.409 --> 18:31.502
F-Fuma...

18:31.578 --> 18:33.136
Why...

18:33.213 --> 18:34.771
Why?

18:34.848 --> 18:37.043
You had such a good chance...

18:38.117 --> 18:39.049
...Kamui!

18:44.524 --> 18:46.992
If you want to kill me...

18:47.060 --> 18:48.652
...come at full strength.

18:57.637 --> 19:01.573
And furthermore, one of the Dragons of Heaven...

19:03.109 --> 19:05.907
It all flows as destiny weaves.

19:06.980 --> 19:08.971
The future is always one.

19:10.550 --> 19:12.381
Even this wish of mine...

19:14.454 --> 19:19.016
...is merely one of the futures decided for me, isn't it?

20:09.676 --> 20:13.305
Have you decided who you want to protect yet?

20:14.380 --> 20:15.711
No, not yet.

20:16.783 --> 20:20.082
But I believe that I'm sure to find that person.

20:21.454 --> 20:24.582
Do you have someone you want to protect, Daisuke?

20:28.394 --> 20:33.195
I want to do my best and become someone like you.

20:33.266 --> 20:35.598
I want to be stronger, and...
